### Requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
### Click "Send Request" above each request. Change the port: 3004 = in-memory (6d), 3005 = MySQL (6e).
@base = http://localhost:3004

### Get all students
GET {{base}}/api/students

### Get one student
GET {{base}}/api/students/1

### Create a student (expect 201)
POST {{base}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sita",
  "email": "sita@example.com",
  "department": "AI&DS",
  "year": 1,
  "cgpa": 9.1
}

### Invalid create (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "A", "email": "not-an-email", "year": 9 }

### Update a student (expect 200)
PUT {{base}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "year": 3, "cgpa": 8.9 }

### Delete a student (expect 204)
DELETE {{base}}/api/students/2

### Not found (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/api/students/999
